# Mod Kepp Hock Legacy — Installation Guide

## Requirements

- Grand Theft Auto V Legacy
- Windows 10 / 11
- ReShade
- Compatible shader effects

## Installation

1. Download ReShade from the official website:
   https://reshade.me/

2. Run the ReShade installer.

3. Select the GTA V Legacy executable file.

4. Select the graphics API detected by the installer.

5. Install the shader package containing these effects:
   - Vibrance
   - Tonemap
   - Curves

6. Copy `KeppHockLegacy.ini` into the ReShade preset folder.

7. Launch GTA V Legacy Story Mode.

8. Open the ReShade overlay and select `KeppHockLegacy.ini`.

9. Enable the available effects and check the result.

## Important

- Intended for Story Mode only.
- Do not use in GTA Online.
- This preset has not been tested on every PC configuration.
- ReShade and shader effects must be installed separately.

## Support

If the preset does not work, check that all required shader effects are installed.